# Build output.
#
# These crates are vendored sources, so a `cargo build` inside any of them
# drops a target/ tree directly beside the code -- and two did, once:
# cubecl-runtime and cubecl-wgpu, 2718 files / 899 MB uncompressed, committed
# onto an orphan branch that is only ~139 files of actual source. cubecl-cuda
# was vendored clean; this keeps it that way. Nothing here should be tracked.
target/
